  - m_Id: 296236889440256
    m_Localized: 'Analytics: ON'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 296236948160512
    m_Localized: 'Analytics: OFF'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 296236948160513
    m_Localized: Anonymous gameplay data
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 296236948160514
    m_Localized: Help us balance the game? We send anonymous gameplay data (combats,
      gold, combos). No personal data. You can change this anytime from the menu.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 296236948160515
    m_Localized: Accept
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 296236948160516
    m_Localized: Decline
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 296236948160517
    m_Localized: Privacy policy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 878601589063680
    m_Localized: Language
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 878601672949760
    m_Localized: Are you sure?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 878601672949761
    m_Localized: Back
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211500024659968
    m_Localized: Contract
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211500091768832
    m_Localized: Minimum damage = highest die
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2019786932191232
    m_Localized: 'Your dice:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2019786974134272
    m_Localized: 'Choose the selected die''s slot:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2019786974134273
    m_Localized: Slot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2019786974134274
    m_Localized: slots
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2019786974134275
    m_Localized: Enchantment
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2019786974134276
    m_Localized: Confirm
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7800251619241984
    m_Localized: Click a tile to move. Walk to the highlighted door to leave the
      room.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7800251719905280
    m_Localized: Combat! This is your enemy. In the tutorial you always act first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7800251719905281
    m_Localized: 'Your hero fights in melee: get close first. Select MOVE ({0}).'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7800251719905282
    m_Localized: The highlighted tiles are your reach this turn. Click a tile next
      to the enemy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7800251719905283
    m_Localized: You're far away and can only move once per turn. Press END TURN
      ({0}) and let them approach.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7800251719905284
    m_Localized: 'This is your HEALTH: if it hits zero, the run is over. Look after
      it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12873216408338432
    m_Localized: No Rolls left.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7800251719905286
    m_Localized: ATTACK ({0}) is unlocked. Select it to choose who to hit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7800251719905287
    m_Localized: 'First pick the target: click the enemy highlighted in red.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7800251719905288
    m_Localized: 'Target locked! These are your dice: hold left click to grab them
      and throw with a quick flick.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7800251719905289
    m_Localized: Build combos (pair, trio, straight). Click locks a die; reroll the
      rest for 1 Roll per throw. Then CONFIRM.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7800251719905290
    m_Localized: "You have Rolls left: DEFENSE unlocked ({0}). Throw the dice and
      build a combo \u2014 it becomes SHIELD."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7800251719905291
    m_Localized: Attack complete! When you're done, press END TURN ({0}) to hand
      over the turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7800251719905292
    m_Localized: "That's how you fight! Repeat the process \u2014 move, attack, build
      combos \u2014 until the enemy is down."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7800251719905293
    m_Localized: 'You got hit! HEAL ({0}) is unlocked: use it on your turn when you''re
      low on health.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7800251719905294
    m_Localized: 'Healing uses the dice too: form a combo to recover more health.
      No combo? Your highest die heals you. Lock and confirm.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7800251719905295
    m_Localized: "Well done! Head through the highlighted door. The other one is
      locked \u2014 you'll open it later."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7800251719905296
    m_Localized: 'Too many! FORCE DOOR ({0}) is unlocked: escape the way you came.
      You''re already next to the door.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7800251719905297
    m_Localized: 'Forcing the door is resolved with dice: throw them and beat the
      threshold to escape the fight.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7800251719905298
    m_Localized: 'The room is unlocked: go in and finish what you started.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7800251719905299
    m_Localized: Now you're ready! With the PAIR upgrade, take down both enemies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7800251719905300
    m_Localized: 'You escaped! The shop door is open. Head in: something useful is
      waiting.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7800251719905301
    m_Localized: 'This is the shop. Walk to the pedestal and press F to buy the upgrade:
      your PAIR combo will deal +50 damage.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7800251719905302
    m_Localized: 'Upgrade bought! Now you''re ready: head back the way you came and
      finish those enemies.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7800251719905303
    m_Localized: 'Excellent! Move on to the last room: the enchantment room.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7800251719905304
    m_Localized: 'This is the enchantment table: it upgrades a die for gold. Walk
      to the altar and press F.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7800251719905305
    m_Localized: 'Pick a die and pull the lever: 3 enchantments appear and the one
      you pick is added to the die.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7800251719905306
    m_Localized: "Die enchanted! You know everything you need \u2014 close the table."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7800251719905307
    m_Localized: Step through the highlighted door to begin your real adventure.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7800251719905308
    m_Localized: Click to continue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7867763907198976
    m_Localized: Coming soon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8535671167614976
    m_Localized: These are your class dice. Click one to add it to your bag; you
      can repeat the same type as many times as you like.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8535671486382080
    m_Localized: Your bag is built here, always sorted from lowest to highest. Click
      a die in the strip to send it back to the pool.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8535671486382081
    m_Localized: Clear empties the whole bag so you can start over.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8535671486382082
    m_Localized: Once your bag is full, Confirm unlocks and starts the run.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9367833236307968
    m_Localized: Active
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
