  - m_Id: 9649666772463616
    m_Localized: 'Speed: x{0}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9946840189206528
    m_Localized: 'Repeated combo: 0 damage'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9946840222760960
    m_Localized: Inventory
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9946840222760961
    m_Localized: Items
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10000862892814336
    m_Localized: Chest opened!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10000862968311808
    m_Localized: +{0} gold
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10000862968311809
    m_Localized: Click to skip
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10000862968311810
    m_Localized: Click to continue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10000862968311811
    m_Localized: Common
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10000862968311812
    m_Localized: Uncommon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10000862968311813
    m_Localized: Rare
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10000862968311814
    m_Localized: Legendary
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10309000887107584
    m_Localized: 'Top right is the turn order: who acts now and who goes next.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10309000929050624
    m_Localized: 'This is your CONTRACT: the generala combos and their damage. Check
      it any time.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10309000929050625
    m_Localized: 'Rotate the camera with the right button. Drag the map with the
      wheel pressed. Zoom: wheel. Try it now.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10309000933244928
    m_Localized: 'Your INVENTORY is unlocked: your purchase lives here, with everything
      else you find in the run.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10309000933244929
    m_Localized: 'None convince you? Pull the lever again for 3 new options: each
      roll costs more gold.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10309000933244930
    m_Localized: 'Your enchanted die lives in the DICE BAG: check your dice and enchantments
      there.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10319614179115008
    m_Localized: 'Escaping doesn''t remove them: the enemies stay in the room, heal
      a little, and wait if you come back.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10319614204280832
    m_Localized: 'Zoom out to see the adjacent rooms: their icons tell you which
      ones are special (shop, enchantment...).'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10374649726468096
    m_Localized: This action can't be performed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10374649764216832
    m_Localized: No target in range.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12873216341229568
    m_Localized: 'This is your ROLL POOL: every dice throw spends 1. Ending your
      turn grants {0} back ({1} max).'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10374649764216834
    m_Localized: Already used this turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10374649764216835
    m_Localized: Your health is already full.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10374649764216836
    m_Localized: You're not next to a door.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10374649764216837
    m_Localized: It's not your turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10378091215814656
    m_Localized: You have no potion available.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10403289960906752
    m_Localized: 'You can reroll without limit: each throw spends 1 Roll from your
      pool.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11862063171076096
    m_Localized: Description
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12926848403161088
    m_Localized: 'Throw the dice: the better the combo, the more SHIELD. Confirm
      and absorb the next hit.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12939077386862592
    m_Localized: 1 Turn
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
